{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>And this shall be for you as an everlasting statute, to make atonement.</b> The day itself makes atonement, even if there be no Temple and no sacrificial service, as they said: תְּשׁוּבָה תּוֹלָה וְיוֹם הַכִּפּוּרִים מְכַפֵּר — repentance suspends [punishment] and Yom Kippur makes atonement."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:31.575413845Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}